{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01959","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 彩凤逐帷低 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 彩凤逐帷低","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巧绣双飞凤，朝朝伴下帷。\n春花那见照，暮色已频欺。\n欲卷思君处，将嗁裛泪时。\n何年征戍客？传语报佳期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}